<title>THAILAND: Thai cabinet approves 9.0 pct 97/98 budget rise.</title>
<headline>Thai cabinet approves 9.0 pct 97/98 budget rise.</headline>
<dateline>BANGKOK 1997-04-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Thai cabinet on Thursday approved a proposal to increase the national budget for the 1997/1998 (October/September) fiscal year by nine percent, the transport minister said.</p>
<p>The 1997/98 budget will amount to 1,008 billion baht ($38.8 billion), up from 925 billion baht in 1996/97, Suwat Liptapallop told reporters after the cabinet meeting.</p>
